01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:21.000
And during that month, you go over all the Baha'u'llah, Mashiach, that you studied.

01:11:21.000 --> 01:11:26.000
So you come out, studying, knowing Obama and Messiah.

01:11:26.000 --> 01:11:32.000
