01:11:44.000 --> 01:11:50.000
Alright. That's my interpretation. I mean, I don't agree with this interpretation which I'm giving myself.

01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:55.760
They are beautiful but I don't agree with it. So therefore, Zubi Zubi lo altaviyatam.

01:11:55.760 --> 01:11:59.440
