01:16:29.988 --> 01:16:42.988
Frequency. Maybe it's successful. Maybe you're going to go to a small town in the south of San Antonio and you'll be able to succeed. Maybe.

01:16:42.988 --> 01:16:52.988
Maybe, you know, just all I can tell you is the question of frequency of the statistics, which I think is a very sophisticated way to solve the problem.

01:16:52.988 --> 01:16:59.988
Alright, any comments? Yes.

01:16:59.988 --> 01:17:07.988
