01:18:27.982 --> 01:18:40.982
Rabim, harbe'asu ke Rabi Shmael, harbe'asu ke Rabi Shuman Bar Yochai. Now, there were multitudes on both sides. Only I could tell you the results. And you have to know those things.

01:18:40.982 --> 01:18:55.982
