01:19:16.982 --> 01:19:24.982
Asur Turatam Keva, Zul Zul Atami Adam. No, Asur Turatam Keva, Zul Zul Atami Adam. It doesn't tell you what is Asur, what is Asur.

01:19:24.982 --> 01:19:31.982
