Oshu Hanal, I know people. I remember once I had a discussion with somebody. None of you know the person.

01:32:59.263 --> 01:33:06.263
Isaac Shalom, the imram of the Prophet, and he says about, he said there was a rabbi, and he said,

01:33:06.263 --> 01:33:10.023
Ah! This rabbi only knows Shohar Aluf.

01:33:12.023 --> 01:33:23.394
So I said only knows Shohar Aluf Albaia would be going what do you mean only know Shohar al You think that knowing Shohar al is little It a fantastic accomplishment

01:33:23.394 --> 01:33:35.394
I say a lawyer does not know Alba Shohar al-Aruch. A lawyer knows some simaim of each Shohar al-Aruch. This guy knows Alba Shohar al-Aruch, you think he only Shohar al-Aruch?

01:33:35.394 --> 01:33:44.834
So, the question is, you have to know also. I mean, I applaud this man. I became a great fan of that man.

01:33:44.834 --> 01:33:50.354
Because you guys say, this is only Shoharut. The question is, I don't know Gemara. I don't know.

01:33:50.354 --> 01:33:57.794
I know only Shoharut. That was Hakham Hasmul. Probably died before you were born.

01:33:57.794 --> 01:34:01.874
I know only Shoharut. I know somebody else. You know only Tara.

01:34:01.874 --> 01:34:07.434
Is that Hacham? Is that Mishani? All in Tena. All in Tena. Inside of him.

01:34:07.434 --> 01:34:15.634
So, the question is, sometimes we have to make a choice, and the choice will shape our personality, if it is the right choice.

01:34:15.634 --> 01:34:17.634
But you cannot say that everybody...

